  83               
  84                /SYSTEM HANDLER TABLE
  85                /CONTENTS:
  86                /BIT 0  - ON IF THE HANDLER IS A TWO-PAGE HANDLER
  87                /BITS 1-4 - OFFSET FROM "DVHORG-1" OF RECORD CONTAINING HANDLER
  88                /BITS 5-11 - ENTRY POINT OF HANDLER RELATIVE TO LOADING ADDRESS
  89               
  90               
  91               /EACH DEVICE HANDLER HAS AN ENTRY IN SDVHND. THE EQUATION
  92               /USED IN EACH ENTRY IS: OFFSET *200+ENTRY POINT-ASSEMBLY POINT
  93               /THE OFFSET IS BITS 1-4.
  94               /FOR A TWO PAGE HANDLER, ADD 4000.
